  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual metaphor of impending extinction",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the apocalyptic metaphor expressed in the bottom text 'i'm about to end man', which is analogically mapped onto the visual material (rats). The user sees themselves as the subject of this hyperbolic threat, identifying with the perspective of the entity (rats) that is metaphorically 'about to end man'. This projection is not explicit with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but is implied through the user's identification with the meme's perspective and the framing of the rats as the agent of catastrophic destruction.",
